{"id":28434,"author":"_DISTRACTION_","body":"\u003ch1\u003eOctober Week 2\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003ch2\u003eBiweekly Rotation Update #2\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHello everyone,\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWelcome to the second biweekly rotation update. Some exciting new maps have been added, and some have been removed (based on community feedback and gameplay.)\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eThe rotations will receive updates every two weeks,\u0026nbsp;at a minimum. This is not a static restriction; there may be a case where we will release an update on a week after a previous update.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003ci\u003eIn these updates, maps needing removal shall be replaced with new maps from the testing list, or with older maps that have been out of rotations recently. The updates are not meant to be complete overhauls of the rotations; they can instead be considered general maintenance.\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e»\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eDestroy Update\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e«\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eVictory\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003ewas removed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eTallon Overworld\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003ewas removed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eAquatic Urbex\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=3cce00809faa48f982cf64410305822a} {tag=c2a4c847653e482ab62ed7f8b64330cb} and {tag=99cac770bfc54dcdbcae678e8b4b9ee8}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eMute City 2\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=da98a2f1673c4cecb547e0a342abfde4}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDaisy\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=50a34639abb34cf1b182204756c49f49}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eClay Wars\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=48924ea33aad4e16838c368d8d9e0a25}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEmbers 1\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=da98a2f1673c4cecb547e0a342abfde4}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e»\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eCapture Update\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e«\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eMadness\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003ewas removed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eApollo 13\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;was removed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eSahandus\u003c/b\u003e\u0026nbsp;was removed.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eAqueous\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by\u0026nbsp;{tag=68cfe240d81c46ae8a939e3eb5d71e3e} and {tag=883055fb316542919ded7f279ff5381f}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eEnder Hill\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=42b105207c51425292d98b65df108b12}\u0026nbsp;{tag=3cce00809faa48f982cf64410305822a}\u0026nbsp;and {tag=c2a4c847653e482ab62ed7f8b64330cb}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e»\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eConquest Update\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e«\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eNevadaca\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by\u0026nbsp;{tag=883055fb316542919ded7f279ff5381f}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e»\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003eWalls Update\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e«\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003ctable class=\"highlight tab-size-8 js-file-line-container\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; border-spacing: 0px; outline: 0px; border-color: rgb(134, 201, 255); box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.075) 0px 1px 1px inset, rgba(82, 168, 236, 0.6) 0px 0px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Helvetica, arial, nimbussansl, liberationsans, freesans, clean, sans-serif, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Emoji\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Symbol\u0026quot;;\"\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd class=\"blob-num js-line-number\" style=\"padding: 0px 10px; min-width: 50px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eGrotto Arena\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e(by {tag=7041fe1f5d344373b6dc8a7d4605033b}) was added.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eHere are this week's sneak peeks. A plus means that a map will be added, while a minus means that it will be removed. Please keep in mind that the update may be modified after the sneak peeks are posted.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e»\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: r